      <p class="adt-body text-left italic text-[#3a3333] mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        <span data-id="pg075_n0019">Duke shfryt&#xeb;zuar tok&#xeb;n e punueshme, n&#xeb; vendin ton&#xeb; &#xeb;sht&#xeb; zhvilluar bujq&#xeb;sia, prej s&#xeb; cil&#xeb;s marrim shum&#xeb; prodhime bujq&#xeb;sore, si: fruta, perime e drith&#xeb;ra.</span>
