      <p class="adt-body text-left italic text-[#3a3333] mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        <span data-id="pg075_n0021">Po ashtu, &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e zhvilluar blegtoria - deg&#xeb; e ekonomis&#xeb;, e cila merret me rritjen e kafsh&#xeb;ve, si: delet e lop&#xeb;t, t&#xeb; cilat kan&#xeb; mund&#xeb;suar rritjen e prodhimit t&#xeb; mishit, t&#xeb; qum&#xeb;shtit dhe t&#xeb; produkteve t&#xeb; tij.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="adt-body text-left italic text-[#3a3333] mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        <span data-id="pg075_n0023">Kosova prodhon energji elektrike, duke shfryt&#xeb;zuar th&#xeb;ngjillin si pasuri n&#xeb;ntok&#xeb;sore.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="adt-body text-left italic text-[#3a3333] mb-4 leading-relaxed">
